---
title: Task Lifecycle & Checklist AI Generation
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Cell as ColumnSection<br/>(ColumnSection.tsx)
    participant Card as TaskCard<br/>(task/TaskCard.tsx)
    participant TaskModal as TaskCreateModal /<br/>TaskEditModal / TaskViewOnlyModal<br/>(task/modal/; Edit + ViewOnly share<br/>ExistingTaskModalWrapper)
    participant Form as task fields<br/>(FieldsGrid: TitleInput,<br/>DescriptionEditor, StatusSteps,<br/>ProjectMenu, ChecklistSection)
    participant Actions as action hooks<br/>(actions/task*.ts, checklistAi.ts)
    participant Reducer as reducers<br/>(tasks.ts, checklist.ts, checklistAi.ts)
    participant Ctx as BoardContext<br/>(TaskCreate/TaskEdit/ChecklistAI/<br/>BoardData/TasksByCell)
    participant AI as /api/generate-tasks<br/>(Google GenAI)
    participant Comments as TaskComments<br/>(task/comments/TaskComments.tsx,<br/>useTaskComments.ts)
    participant Store as commentStore<br/>(task/comments/commentStore.ts)
    participant CommentsAPI as /api/task-comments<br/>(Deno KV task_comment entries)

    Note over User,AI: Create task: open modal
    User->>Cell: click "add task"
    Cell->>Actions: openTaskForm(rowId, colId)<br/>(actions/task.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/OPEN_CREATE_MODAL, {rowId, colId})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.openCreateModal(state, payload)
    Reducer-->>Ctx: taskCreateModalOpen = true<br/>taskDraft = emptyTaskDraft(rowId, colId)<br/>resets ChecklistAI slice
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskCreateModal re-renders<br/>(TaskCreateContext: taskCreateModalOpen=true)<br/>-> opens
    TaskModal-->>Form: task fields + ChecklistSection mount<br/>(taskDraft = empty draft)

    Note over User,AI: Create task: edit fields
    User->>Form: edit title / description
    Form->>Actions: setTaskDraft(draft)<br/>(actions/taskCreate.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/UPDATE_DRAFT, {draft})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.updateDraft(state, payload)
    Reducer-->>Ctx: taskDraft = draft
    Ctx-->>Form: task fields re-render<br/>(TaskCreateContext: taskDraft changed)

    Note over User,AI: Create task: checklist editing (target = "draft")
    User->>Form: add / edit / delete / reorder checklist item<br/>(ChecklistSection)
    Form->>Actions: addChecklistItem / updateChecklistItem /<br/>deleteChecklistItem / reorderChecklistItem<br/>(actions/taskCreate.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST/ADD_ITEM | UPDATE_ITEM |<br/>DELETE_ITEM | REORDER_ITEM, {target:"draft", ...})
    Ctx->>Reducer: checklist.addItem / updateItem /<br/>removeItem / reorderItem<br/>(insertKey / reorderKey from ordering.ts)
    Reducer-->>Ctx: taskDraft.checklist updated
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistSection re-renders<br/>(TaskCreateContext: taskDraft.checklist changed)<br/>-> item list updates
    Note over Form,Reducer: Top item is always an empty entry row (no trash/drag).<br/>Enter / blur / Shift+Enter on it with text, or a checklist<br/>change leaving checklist[0] non-empty and unfocused<br/>(useEffect), calls addChecklistItem(_, 0) -> CHECKLIST/ADD_ITEM<br/>with insertBeforeIndex 0. Same for the edit modal below.

    Note over User,AI: Create task: submit
    User->>Form: submit form
    Form->>Actions: createTask(event, description)<br/>(description = editor getJSON();<br/>actions/taskCreate.ts)
    Actions->>Actions: task = {id: createId(),<br/>order: generateKeyBetween(null, firstOrder),<br/>title, description (falls back to draft),<br/>checklist: non-empty items}
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/CREATE, {task})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.create(state, {task})
    Reducer-->>Ctx: tasks = [task, ...tasks]<br/>taskCreateModalOpen = false<br/>resets ChecklistAI slice
    Ctx->>Ctx: computeTasksByCell(tasks)
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskCreateModal re-renders<br/>(TaskCreateContext: taskCreateModalOpen=false)<br/>-> modal closes, unmounts Form
    Ctx-->>Cell: ColumnSection (target cell) re-renders<br/>(TasksByCellContext changed)<br/>-> new TaskCard mounts as child

    Note over User,AI: Edit task: open modal
    User->>Card: click title
    Card->>Actions: startEditTask(task)<br/>(actions/task.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/OPEN_EDIT_MODAL, {task})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.openEditModal(state, {task})
    Reducer-->>Ctx: editingTaskId = task.id<br/>editTaskDraft = normalized clone<br/>taskEditModalOpen = true
    Card->>Card: navigate(/dashboard/task/:id)
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskEditModal re-renders<br/>(TaskEditContext: taskEditModalOpen=true)<br/>-> opens (task not in Trash)
    TaskModal-->>Form: task fields + ChecklistSection mount<br/>(taskDraft = editTaskDraft)

    Note over User,AI: Edit task: edit fields & checklist (target = "editDraft")
    User->>Form: edit title / description / status (colId) / row (rowId)<br/>(Status never lists the Trash column)
    Form->>Actions: setEditTaskDraft(draft)<br/>(actions/taskEdit.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/UPDATE_EDIT_DRAFT, {draft})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.updateEditDraft(state, payload)
    Reducer-->>Ctx: editTaskDraft = draft
    Ctx-->>Form: task fields re-render<br/>(TaskEditContext: editTaskDraft changed)

    User->>Form: add / edit / delete / reorder checklist item<br/>(ChecklistSection)
    Form->>Actions: addEditChecklistItem / updateEditChecklistItem /<br/>deleteEditChecklistItem / reorderEditChecklistItem<br/>(actions/taskEdit.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST/..., {target:"editDraft", ...})
    Ctx->>Reducer: checklist.* (editTaskDraft branch)
    Reducer-->>Ctx: editTaskDraft.checklist updated
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistSection re-renders<br/>(TaskEditContext: editTaskDraft.checklist changed)<br/>-> item list updates<br/>(empty top entry row kept as in create)

    Note over User,AI: Edit task: save
    User->>Form: submit form
    Form->>Actions: saveTaskEdit(event, description)<br/>(actions/taskEdit.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/UPDATE_EDIT_DRAFT,<br/>{draft: {...editTaskDraft, description}}<br/>(skipped if description undefined))
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.updateEditDraft
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/SAVE_EDIT)
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.saveEdit(state)
    Reducer-->>Ctx: tasks updated (title/description/rowId/colId/checklist)<br/>editingTaskId = null, editTaskDraft = null<br/>taskEditModalOpen = false
    TaskModal->>TaskModal: navigate(/dashboard)
    Ctx->>Ctx: computeTasksByCell(tasks)
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskEditModal re-renders<br/>(TaskEditContext: taskEditModalOpen=false)<br/>-> modal closes, unmounts Form
    Ctx-->>Cell: ColumnSection(s) re-render<br/>(TasksByCellContext changed)<br/>-> TaskCard moves to new cell if rowId/colId<br/>changed, otherwise updates in place

    Note over User,AI: Trash task (edit modal dock, task not in Trash)
    User->>Form: click "Trash" (edit modal only)
    Form->>Actions: trashTask(taskId)<br/>(actions/task.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/TRASH, {taskId})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.trash(state, {taskId})
    Reducer-->>Ctx: colId = Trash column (same row), order = end of Trash cell<br/>trashedAt = now, preTrashColId = old colId<br/>closes edit modal
    TaskModal->>TaskModal: navigate(/dashboard)
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskEditModal re-renders<br/>(TaskEditContext: taskEditModalOpen=false)<br/>-> modal closes, unmounts Form
    Ctx-->>Cell: source + Trash ColumnSection re-render<br/>(TasksByCellContext changed)<br/>-> TaskCard remounts in Trash with<br/>"N days until permanent deletion."
    Note over Actions,CommentsAPI: Comments are kept. They are deleted with the task by<br/>POST /api/purge-trash (KV) once trashedAt is 30+ days old

    Note over User,AI: Open a trashed task (view-only) and Restore
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskViewOnlyModal re-renders<br/>(TaskEditContext: taskEditModalOpen=true,<br/>colId is the Trash column; isTaskTrashed)<br/>-> opens; TaskEditModal stays closed
    Note over TaskModal,Form: "Task is view-only" alert above Status/Project.<br/>ExistingTaskModalWrapper viewOnly wraps title/fields/comments<br/>in preventEdits (capture-phase preventDefault).<br/>Editor limited to "visual-only", Status shows preTrashColId,<br/>no AI checklist generation.<br/>Dock = Delete forever + Cancel + Restore
    User->>Form: click "Restore"
    Form->>Actions: restoreTask(taskId)<br/>(actions/task.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/RESTORE, {taskId})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.restore(state, {taskId})
    Reducer-->>Ctx: colId = preTrashColId (fallback findTodoColumnId<br/>if that column was deleted), order = end of cell<br/>trashedAt = null, preTrashColId = null<br/>closes edit modal
    TaskModal->>TaskModal: navigate(/dashboard)
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskViewOnlyModal re-renders -> modal closes
    Ctx-->>Cell: Trash + destination ColumnSection re-render<br/>(TasksByCellContext changed)

    Note over User,AI: Delete a trashed task permanently (view-only dock)
    User->>Form: click "Delete forever"
    Form->>Actions: deleteTask(taskId)<br/>(actions/task.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(TASK/DELETE, {taskId})
    Ctx->>Reducer: tasks.remove(state, {taskId})
    Reducer-->>Ctx: tasks filtered<br/>closes edit modal if it was the edited task
    Actions->>Store: deleteAllComments(taskId) (fire-and-forget)
    Store->>CommentsAPI: DELETE {taskId}<br/>(or localStorage / in-memory demo)
    TaskModal->>TaskModal: navigate(/dashboard)
    Ctx-->>TaskModal: TaskViewOnlyModal re-renders<br/>(TaskEditContext: taskEditModalOpen=false)<br/>-> modal closes, unmounts Form
    Ctx-->>Cell: Trash ColumnSection re-renders<br/>(TasksByCellContext changed)<br/>-> TaskCard unmounts

    Note over User,CommentsAPI: Task comments (edit + view-only modals; local state, outside the reducer)
    TaskModal->>Comments: render TaskComments(taskId)<br/>(desktop: 30% sidebar; mobile: below form)
    Comments->>Ctx: useBoardMeta() -> {boardId, isAuthenticated}
    Comments->>Store: listComments(taskId)
    alt isAuthenticated
        Store->>CommentsAPI: GET ?taskId
    else anonymous
        Store->>Store: read localStorage kanby-comments-v0-1-0
    else demo board
        Store->>Store: in-memory Map
    end
    Store-->>Comments: TaskComment[] (newest first)
    User->>Comments: post / edit / delete a comment
    Comments->>Store: createComment / updateComment / deleteComment
    Store->>CommentsAPI: POST / PATCH / DELETE<br/>(or localStorage / in-memory demo)
    Comments->>Comments: setState -> only TaskComments re-renders
    Note over Comments,Ctx: no dispatch; board autosave unaffected

    Note over User,AI: Checklist AI: generate suggestions
    User->>Form: open "Generate checklist" panel,<br/>edit prompt (ChecklistSection)
    Form->>Actions: setChecklistPrompt(prompt)<br/>(actions/checklistAi.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST_AI/SET_PROMPT, {prompt})
    Ctx->>Reducer: checklistAi.setPrompt
    Reducer-->>Ctx: checklistPrompt = prompt
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistGenerationCollapse re-renders<br/>(reads ChecklistAIContext itself: checklistPrompt changed)

    User->>Form: click "Generate Checklist Items"
    Form->>Actions: generateChecklistItems(taskDraft)<br/>(actions/checklistAi.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST_AI/GENERATE_START, {taskId})
    Ctx->>Reducer: checklistAi.generateStart
    Reducer-->>Ctx: isGeneratingChecklist = true<br/>checklistModalTaskId = taskId
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistGenerationCollapse re-renders<br/>(reads ChecklistAIContext itself: isGeneratingChecklist=true)<br/>-> "Generate" button disabled, shows "Generating..."

    Actions->>AI: fetchGeneratedItems(prompt, 10)<br/>(actions/shared.ts)<br/>POST /api/generate-tasks {prompt, maxTasks:10}
    AI->>AI: GoogleGenAI.generateContentStream(...)<br/>normalizeTaskLines(fullText)
    AI-->>Actions: {response: string[]}

    alt success
        Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST_AI/GENERATE_SUCCESS, {items})
        Ctx->>Reducer: checklistAi.generateSuccess
        Reducer-->>Ctx: isGeneratingChecklist = false<br/>checklistPreview = items
    else failure
        Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST_AI/GENERATE_FAILURE, {error})
        Ctx->>Reducer: checklistAi.generateFailure
        Reducer-->>Ctx: isGeneratingChecklist = false<br/>checklistModalError = error
    end
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistGenerationCollapse re-renders<br/>(reads ChecklistAIContext itself: checklistPreview /<br/>checklistModalError changed)<br/>-> shows preview list or error message

    Note over User,AI: Checklist AI: apply suggestions
    User->>Form: click "Copy checklist items to task"
    alt create modal
        Form->>Actions: applyChecklistPreviewToDraft()<br/>(actions/checklistAi.ts)
        Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST_AI/APPLY_TO_CREATE_DRAFT)
        Ctx->>Reducer: checklistAi.applyToCreateDraft<br/>(appendItems via generateNKeysBetween)
        Reducer-->>Ctx: taskDraft.checklist += items<br/>checklistPreview = []
    else edit modal
        Form->>Actions: applyChecklistPreview()<br/>(actions/checklistAi.ts)
        Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST_AI/APPLY_TO_EDIT_DRAFT)
        Ctx->>Reducer: checklistAi.applyToEditDraft<br/>(guards checklistModalTaskId === editTaskDraft.id)
        Reducer-->>Ctx: editTaskDraft.checklist += items<br/>resets ChecklistAI slice
    end
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistGenerationCollapse re-renders<br/>(reads ChecklistAIContext itself: checklistPreview=[])<br/>-> preview hides, "Generate" button reappears
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistSection item list re-renders<br/>(TaskCreateContext / TaskEditContext:<br/>draft.checklist changed)<br/>-> new items appear

    Note over User,AI: Checklist AI: discard suggestions
    User->>Form: click "Empty generated items"
    Form->>Actions: clearChecklistPreview()<br/>(actions/checklistAi.ts)
    Actions->>Ctx: dispatch(CHECKLIST_AI/RESET)
    Ctx->>Reducer: checklistAi.reset
    Reducer-->>Ctx: ChecklistAI slice reset
    Ctx-->>Form: ChecklistGenerationCollapse re-renders<br/>(reads ChecklistAIContext itself reset)<br/>-> reverts to empty-prompt "Generate" state

    Note over User,AI: Autosave (debounced, async)
    Ctx->>Ctx: useEffect on tasks (500ms debounce)
    Ctx->>Ctx: PUT /api/board {rows, columns, tasks}<br/>(or localStorage if unauthenticated)
